# webview_go asks pkg-config for webkit2gtk-4.0; distros since 2024 ship
# only 4.1, which has the same API (it moved to libsoup 3). This stands in
# for 4.0 by pulling in 4.1: build.sh puts this directory on PKG_CONFIG_PATH.
Name: webkit2gtk-4.0
Description: webkit2gtk-4.1, under the name webview_go asks for
Version: 2.40
Requires: webkit2gtk-4.1
